/*
  Second interior exactness of the retained whole-H window, at H(C).
  The direct connecting formula supplies an epic presentation. Correct its
  lifted middle arrow by an actual left boundary, lift the resulting cycle
  into the retained H(B), then use the established exact-cover criterion.
  The public theorem derives all factors from the original rows/model data.
  Exactness at H(A') and the remaining full-goal obligations are downstream.
*/
